  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.090" end="00:08.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">'Cause you're my pretty (ooh, ooh)</p>
      <p begin="00:09.490" end="00:17.490" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Definition of beauty (ooh, ooh)</p>
      <p begin="00:18.650" end="00:22.440" ttm:agent="v1">Pretty girl, you make everything feel alright</p>
      <p begin="00:22.440" end="00:26.210" ttm:agent="v1">Pretty girl, pretty as the stars in the sky</p>
      <p begin="00:26.210" end="00:31.930" ttm:agent="v1">Belt of Orion, the way we're aligning</p>
      <p begin="00:31.930" end="00:36.560" ttm:agent="v1">And heaven knows that it breaks my soul, oh</p>
      <p begin="00:36.560" end="00:40.350" ttm:agent="v1">When you don't know you're beautiful</p>
      <p begin="00:40.350" end="00:44.050" ttm:agent="v1">And I won't let it go, oh</p>
      <p begin="00:44.050" end="00:46.100" ttm:agent="v1">I need you to know</p>
      <p begin="00:46.100" end="00:54.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">That you're my pretty (ooh, ooh)</p>
      <p begin="00:54.760" end="01:02.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Definition of beauty (ooh, ooh)</p>
      <p begin="01:02.900" end="01:06.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And out of everything I've seen (everything I've seen)</p>
      <p begin="01:06.090" end="01:11.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Nothing can compete with you (nothing can compete)</p>
      <p begin="01:11.160" end="01:19.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">My pretty (ooh, ooh, ooh)</p>
      <p begin="01:20.200" end="01:27.980" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:27.980" end="01:30.970" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, the sun has good taste</p>
      <p begin="01:30.970" end="01:35.820" ttm:agent="v1">He's peeking through the blinders just to get a glimpse of your face</p>
      <p begin="01:35.820" end="01:38.520" ttm:agent="v1">And he traveled quite a way</p>
      <p begin="01:38.520" end="01:43.470" ttm:agent="v1">90 million miles to see what I get to see everyday</p>
      <p begin="01:43.470" end="01:49.060" ttm:agent="v1">Hey, darling, you're beautiful in every single way</p>
      <p begin="01:49.060" end="01:51.140" ttm:agent="v1">And there's nothing I'll change</p>
      <p begin="01:51.140" end="01:54.960" ttm:agent="v1">Hey, my love stays the same</p>
      <p begin="01:54.960" end="02:02.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">'Cause you're my pretty (ooh, ooh)</p>
      <p begin="02:03.910" end="02:11.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Definition of beauty (ooh, ooh)</p>
      <p begin="02:11.660" end="02:15.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And out of everything I've seen (everything I've seen)</p>
      <p begin="02:15.180" end="02:19.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Nothing can compete with you (nothing can compete)</p>
      <p begin="02:19.460" end="02:24.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">My pretty (ooh, ooh, ooh)</p>
      <p begin="02:24.620" end="02:28.620" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
